/**
 * atomic-data.js: cited reference data for the atomic-scale pages (atom.html,
 * atomic-ladder.html). Data only, SI units unless a name says otherwise.
 * Every value names its source and URL; all sources retrieved 2026-10-07.
 * The element and nucleus tables were generated by a script from the fetched
 * files (no hand-typed table values apart from the radius figure, which was
 * read from the published figure and spot-checked).
 *
 * Contents
 *   CODATA       fundamental constants (CODATA 2022, NIST)
 *   PDG_QUARKS   up and down quark masses (Particle Data Group 2025)
 *   LIMITS       experimental upper limits on the size of quarks and the electron
 *   LATTICES     lattice constants of copper, gold and silicon
 *   LIFE         sizes of a bacterium, a virus and the DNA double helix
 *   ATOM_RADII   free-atom radii for Z = 1-96 (Rahm, Hoffmann & Ashcroft 2016)
 *   NUCLEI       one isotope per element: mass number, rms charge radius, atomic mass
 */

